```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Frontend as Frontend (Web UI)
    participant DBService as db-service (FastAPI)
    participant RepoScanner as repo_scanner (FastAPI)
    participant SystemScan as system-scaner (FastAPI)
    participant ScanService as scan-service (FastAPI)
    participant Agent as System Agent (Linux/Windows)
    participant Postgres as PostgreSQL

    Frontend->>DBService: API Calls (URL scans)
    Frontend->>RepoScanner: API Calls (Repo scans)
    Frontend->>SystemScan: API Calls (Agent management)
    DBService->>Postgres: SQLAlchemy (scandb)
    RepoScanner->>Postgres: SQLAlchemy (repo_scanner_db)
    SystemScan->>Postgres: SQLAlchemy (system_scanner_db)
    ScanService->>DBService: HTTP API Calls (store results)
    Agent->>SystemScan: HTTP (register, heartbeat, tasks, results)
```
